WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.109
As soon as you tell me
I can't do something,

00:00:03.109 --> 00:00:03.900
I'm going to do it.

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:11.230
I hope that in
sharing with you what

00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:14.680
I've learned over 50 years
of writing that it will help

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:17.110
you find your way as a writer.

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:24.420
As a 12-year-old, I was
obsessed by the idea of growing

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.230
breasts and getting my period.

00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:29.110
But there was no place
that I could read about it.

00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:34.090
When I started to write, I
was determined to be honest.

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:37.120
So I'm going to share with you
the practical side of writing.

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:45.460
There's nothing more
important than character.

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:48.400
You're living with
these people for years.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.350
You had better feel for them.

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:51.610
Do some exercises.

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:54.580
Have your character
write a letter to you.

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:57.190
The first draft is
pure torture for me.

00:00:57.190 --> 00:00:58.990
I hate every second of it.

00:00:58.990 --> 00:01:02.110
I have a messy
mind, and my writing

00:01:02.110 --> 00:01:05.080
is a process of
cleaning up the mess,

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:07.870
then slowly making a story.

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:10.246
I will be able to
show that to you.

00:01:13.030 --> 00:01:15.800
I got a particularly
nasty review once.

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:18.350
It got to me, and I
took my typewriter,

00:01:18.350 --> 00:01:21.750
and I held it over
this arroyo.

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:24.710
And I was going to throw it in.

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:28.470
I thought I cannot
do this anymore.

00:01:28.470 --> 00:01:31.470
And then this little
voice went off in my head.

00:01:31.470 --> 00:01:36.410
Wait, you're going to let
this one review stop you

00:01:36.410 --> 00:01:38.390
from writing?

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:39.740
That's crazy!

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:40.550
That's one opinion.

00:01:43.510 --> 00:01:48.280
I enjoy finding and
supporting new writers,

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:53.680
and this is a chance for
me to reach more of you.

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:55.930
I always ask myself,
why would anyone

00:01:55.930 --> 00:01:57.820
write if they didn't have to?

00:01:57.820 --> 00:01:59.950
I mean it's so hard.

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:05.610
So this is for all of you
who feel that you have to.

00:02:05.610 --> 00:02:09.740
I'm Judy Blume, and
this is my Master Class.

